lacking comprehensive stratification based on surgical intervention status. For example, Chen et al. demonstrated that chemotherapy might improve survival outcomes in patients with T1c tumors but not in those with T1a or T1b tumors (11). Li et al. observed that radiotherapy may be advantageous for elderly patients or those with
